onds to a command I re-ran green in this workspace, so I left it as is.\n\nNot run: the race detector and cross-OS builds, since neither is a declared gate for this task.","ttft_ms":4371,"type":"result","duration_ms":958248,"uuid":"6054b0de-9925-4301-b831-3d756bd35076","ttft_stream_ms":3328,"time_to_request_ms":17,"queued_turn_count":0}
